witchinggadgets_research_text.GEMCUT_TABLE=[WG]輝煌
witchinggadgets_research_page.GEMCUT_TABLE.1=<IMG>witchinggadgets:textures/gui/research/gemcuts.png:80:0:80:80:1</IMG>The table cut is
witchinggadgets_research_name.GEMCUT_STEP=階梯琢型
witchinggadgets_research_text.GEMCUT_STEP=[WG]寒芒
witchinggadgets_research_page.GEMCUT_STEP.1=<IMG>witchinggadgets:textures/gui/research/gemcuts.png:160:0:80:80:1</IMG>The table cut is
witchinggadgets_research_name.GEMCUT_ROSE=玫瑰琢型
witchinggadgets_research_text.GEMCUT_ROSE=[WG]閃耀
witchinggadgets_research_page.GEMCUT_ROSE.1=<IMG>witchinggadgets:textures/gui/research/gemcuts.png:0:80:80:80:1</IMG>The table cut is
witchinggadgets_research_name.GEMCUT_OVAL=橢圓琢型
witchinggadgets_research_text.GEMCUT_OVAL=[WG]微光
witchinggadgets_research_page.GEMCUT_OVAL.1=<IMG>witchinggadgets:textures/gui/research/gemcuts.png:80:80:80:80:1</IMG>橢圓琢型是寶石雕琢的頂點。這種琢型的寶石會用在飾品製作上，也可鑲嵌在大多數的護甲和工具上，為其賦予對應效果。檢視後續頁面中的列表以瞭解更多。


